WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.200
Start the authorized EigenVista app session and give your coding agent the

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.280
session note path. Tell it to check the version and capabilities, preserve any

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:14.350
open work, and use approved input and result folders. The private connection

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.085
descriptor stays on your machine.

00:00:16.542 --> 00:00:21.106
Ask the agent to open water and resolve the oxygen and hydrogen identities.

00:00:21.106 --> 00:00:26.725
Have it add one bond distance and the angle with oxygen in the middle. Ask for

00:00:26.725 --> 00:00:31.290
the accepted values and units. The app table provides the check before the

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:34.099
agent exports a figure and C S V.

00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:41.057
Tell the agent to open the one A O N deposit. Ask it to verify the reported

00:00:41.057 --> 00:00:46.008
atom and chain counts, then make chain and entity colored cartoons using the

00:00:46.008 --> 00:00:50.197
same camera. Chain colors mark separate deposited copies. Entity colors group

00:00:50.197 --> 00:00:52.482
copies from the same deposited entity.

00:00:53.018 --> 00:00:57.748
Give the agent the complete ligand identity, including its author and label

00:00:57.748 --> 00:01:03.088
chain. Ask it to use the same seed atoms on both neighborhood runs. Read the

00:01:03.088 --> 00:01:07.028
accepted counts before interpreting the difference between atom centers and

00:01:07.028 --> 00:01:08.275
complete residues.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:13.850
Ask for excluded and accessible water surfaces using identical radii, probe,

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:19.110
and grid spacing. Tell the agent to wait for both jobs, check the saved mesh

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:24.390
kinds and triangle counts, and export each at the same camera. It can then try

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:27.950
rendering presets while keeping the calculation parameters fixed.

00:01:28.417 --> 00:01:32.997
Request the figure and measurement table alongside the native project. For the

00:01:32.997 --> 00:01:37.959
ligand example, read back the two deposited atom identities and the two point

00:01:37.959 --> 00:01:42.920
five four six angstrom contact. Open the files before sharing them and record

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.974
the choices that affect what the image shows.
